course: dictionary
lesson: 9445
title: The stamen
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Inside many flowers you will find a stamen. It is the male part of a flower, and its job is to make pollen. Pollen is the fine powder that can rub off on your fingers when you touch a flower.
explain: A stamen has two main parts. The thin stalk is called the filament. The top part, called the anther, is covered in pollen. «In its middle are the stamens, which make a fine powder called pollen.»
explain: Stamens sit near the middle of the flower, close to the carpel. The carpel is the female part, also called the pistil, and it holds tiny ovules. «Pollination happens when pollen gets carried from the stamens to the sticky top of a pistil.» Pollen needs to travel, and bees or the wind can carry it.
fact: A stamen is the male part of a flower that makes pollen.
fact: A stamen has a thin stalk called the filament, with an anther on top covered in pollen.
fact: Pollination is when pollen moves from the stamens to the carpel, usually of another flower of the same kind.
fact: Bees, butterflies, birds and the wind can all carry pollen from one flower to another.
fact: Pollen that reaches the carpel helps the flower make seeds.
exercise: «Stamens are the parts of a flower that make pollen.» What do stamens make? | Stalks | *Pollen | Roots | Petals
exercise: What is the thin stalk of a stamen called? | Ovule | Carpel | Anther | *Filament
exercise: Which part of the flower is the female part? | Anther | Stamen | *Carpel | Petal
test: «Pollination happens when pollen gets carried from the stamens to the sticky top of a pistil.» What can carry pollen? | The stalk of the flower | Petals alone | Roots and leaves | *Bees and the wind
test: «In its middle are the stamens.» Where are the stamens found in a flower? | *In the middle of the flower | On the leaves | Under the ground | At the very edge of the petals
exam: Which sentence about a stamen is correct? | A stamen is the top of a root | A stamen makes seeds | A stamen is the female part | *A stamen makes pollen
